112
00:07:42.851 --> 00:07:45.518
Cart writes must succeed during partial failures.

113
00:07:46.868 --> 00:07:47.785
Correctness:

114
00:07:48.065 --> 00:07:56.897
Never charge twice; never sell the same last unit twice (or compensate within minutes); the right offer is shown for the price that is charged.

115
00:07:57.177 --> 00:07:57.945
Global:

116
00:07:58.225 --> 00:08:06.844
Separate marketplaces per country (currency, tax, language, regulations); data residency where required (VERIFY per country).

117
00:08:08.194 --> 00:08:09.239
Estimation.

118
00:08:09.519 --> 00:08:10.821
Product page reads:

119
00:08:11.101 --> 00:08:16.221
50M shoppers times 20 pages per day about 1B page views per day.

120
00:08:16.501 --> 00:08:23.391
That averages ~12k per second, reaching ~120k per second at a 10 times peak.

121
00:08:23.671 --> 00:08:32.909
Page fan-out: each page calls tens of services, so internal RPS is 10 to 100 times the page RPS (Ch 02).

